	measure '% ICR Linked to Feature' = ```
			
			VAR ICR_Con_Feature = 
			    CALCULATE(
			        COUNTROWS('Jira ICR'), 
			        'Jira ICR'[Issue Feature Delivery] <> "(none)",
			        NOT(ISBLANK('Jira ICR'[Issue Feature Delivery]))
			    )
			
			VAR Totale_ICR = 
			    CALCULATE(
			        COUNTROWS('Jira ICR'), 
			        ALLSELECTED('Jira ICR')
			    )
			
			RETURN 
			COALESCE(DIVIDE(ICR_Con_Feature, Totale_ICR, 0), 0)
			```
